    "12": "Chat 7 of 14. Policy memo from the shift lead: effective immediately, a fee reversal is allowed only when the statement's `statement_age_days` is 30 or less, and the approval limit in handbook rule 6 is $36. These replace the figures in the handbook and in the knowledge base.",
